Package: xios-desktop-defaults
Name: Xios desktop defaults
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Maintainer: Max Leiter <maxwell.leiter@gmail.com>
Author: Max Leiter <maxwell.leiter@gmail.com>
Depends: x11-fonts-sf, fontconfig, dbus, libglib2.0-bin
Section: X11
Priority: optional
Description: Retina, XDG, GTK and session defaults for Xios
 Installs the ambient distro defaults that make X11/GTK/Xfce/GNOME apps feel
 at home on rootless iOS: rootless PATH and XDG directories, UTF-8 locale,
 native iPad retina display profile, Xft antialiasing/DPI resources, GTK3/GTK4
 defaults, a minimal hicolor icon-theme index, touch-friendly cursor sizing,
 and cache/schema/database setup hooks. No binaries are shipped; launchers
 source the profile when present.
